Try another Karaoke booking on November 22 from 1:45–2:15 PM with zero allowances. It may be saved as Pending with a conflict warning, but it must not confirm silently. Move it outside the 1:30–4:45 interval and confirm successfully.

## 11. Explicit conflict approval

