Expected: the second booking can be saved Pending with a conflict warning. On confirmation, first try without a reason and verify it is rejected. Then approve the listed overlap with a meaningful reason. Verify the screen lists the correct conflicting booking, confirmation succeeds only after approval, and the approved-overlap/audit details are recorded.

