## 33. Save and reload all delivery arrangements

Create `Bo Delivery Test`, `09170001033`, on **December 28, 2026**. On the Details tab, test Self-pickup, Lalamove, and Owner-delivered in turn, with fee responsibility Customer, Included in package, and Owner. Enter a fee and delivery note for each save.

